<title>JAPAN: Orix to buy back shares for stock option scheme.</title>
<headline>Orix to buy back shares for stock option scheme.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese leasing company Orix Corp said on Wednesday it would buy back 1.5 billion yen worth of its shares in order to introduce a stock option scheme for its employees.</p>
<p>The purchase would amount to 168,000 shares, it said in a statement.</p>
